OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrillions of dollars have been wiped
OL,7,Foff the stock value of major tech firms
OL,8,Fin the US, Europe and Asia after the US
OL,9,Fmidterm elections sparked concerns of a
OL,10,Fslowdown in artificial intelligence
OL,11,F(AI) development.
OL,13,FIn the US, the tech-heavy Nasdaq share
OL,14,Findex fell 5.5% on Thursday, losing an
OL,15,Festimated $2.5tn (#1.9tn) in market
OL,16,Fvalue, while other key US stock indexes
OL,17,Falso saw big losses.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
