OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestors appear worried about tougher
OL,7,Fregulation of AI, after Democrat
OL,8,Fcandidates expressed their opposition
OL,9,Fto the data centres that are needed to
OL,10,Fpower the technology.
OL,12,FThe share falls comes on top of broader
OL,13,Fconcerns about whether the huge amounts
OL,14,Fbeing spent on AI will pay off.
